response_format.description:
Optional JSON Schema object defining the structure of the response. When provided, the model will generate responses that conform to this schema.

Example:
```json
{
  "type": "json_schema",
  "json_schema": {
    "name": "structured_output",
    "strict": true,
    "schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "response": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "response"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

`{"type":"json_object"}` is also supported.

