first_frame_url.description:
First frame image url or asset://{assetId} 
(for example: asset://asset-20260404242101-76djj)
Cannot be used simultaneously with reference_image_urls, reference_video_urls, or reference_audio_urls.

last_frame_url.description:
End frame image url or asset://{assetId} 
(for example: asset://asset-20260404242101-76djj)
last_frame_url cannot be passed alone; first_frame_url must be provided together with it.

